    },
    {
      "image": "videos/07-future-self-stranger/3.jpg",
      "seconds": 20.23,
      "text": "So every plan you make for later is a favor for a person you have never met. No wonder the hard choices get handed to them. They do not complain. They are not in the room. But here is the strange part. When researchers showed people digitally aged images of their own faces, the saving went up. Make the stranger familiar, and the brain starts paying them.",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": 8,
        "pitch": -1
      },
